\v 21 \w And the Kohathites| strong="H6956" \w* [set forward]{strong=“H5265” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [bearing]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w the sanctuary| strong="H4720" \w*: and the other [did set up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w the tabernacle| strong="H4908" \w* [against they came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}.\f + \fr 10:21 \ft the other: that is, the Gershonites and the Merarites \f* 
\p
