\v 28 Thus were \w the journeyings| strong="H4550" \w* \w of the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w according to their armies| strong="H6635" \w*, [when they set forward]{strong=“H5265” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}.\f + \fr 10:28 \ft Thus: Heb. These \f* 
\p
\v 29 \w And Moses| strong="H4872" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto Hobab| strong="H2246" \w*, \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Raguel| strong="H7467" \w* \w the Midianite| strong="H4084" \w*, [Moses’]{strong=“H4872”} [father in law]{strong=“H2859” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [We are journeying]{strong=“H5265” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w unto the place| strong="H4725" \w* of which the \sc Lord\sc* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [I will give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [it you: come]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [thou with us, and we will do thee good]{strong=“H2895” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”}: for the \sc Lord\sc* [hath spoken]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w good| strong="H2896" \w* \w concerning Israel| strong="H3478" \w*. 
\v 30 [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, I will not go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; [but I will depart]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to mine own land| strong="H776" \w*, \w and to my kindred| strong="H4138" \w*. 
\v 31 [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Leave]{strong=“H5800” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [us not, I pray thee; forasmuch as thou knowest]{strong=“H3045 H3651” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [how we are to encamp]{strong=“H2583” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w in the wilderness| strong="H4057" \w*, \w and thou mayest be to us instead of eyes| strong="H5869" \w*. 
\v 32 [And it shall be, if thou go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [with us, yea, it shall be, that what goodness]{strong=“H2896”} the \sc Lord\sc* [shall do]{strong=“H3190” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [unto us, the same will we do]{strong=“H2895” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} unto thee. 
\p
\v 33 [And they departed]{strong=“H5265” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w from the mount| strong="H2022" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w three| strong="H7969" \w* [days’]{strong=“H3117”} \w journey| strong="H1870" \w*: \w and the ark| strong="H727" \w* \w of the covenant| strong="H1285" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* [went]{strong=“H5265” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w before| strong="H6440" \w* \w them in the three| strong="H7969" \w* [days’]{strong=“H3117”} \w journey| strong="H1870" \w*, [to search out]{strong=“H8446” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w a resting place| strong="H4496" \w* for them. 
\v 34 \w And the cloud| strong="H6051" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* was \w upon them by day| strong="H3119" \w*, [when they went out]{strong=“H5265” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w of the camp| strong="H4264" \w*. 
\v 35 [And it came to pass, when the ark]{strong=“H727”} [set forward]{strong=“H5265” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, \w that Moses| strong="H4872" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Rise up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, \sc Lord\sc*, [and let thine enemies]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [be scattered]{strong=“H6327” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; [and let them that hate]{strong=“H8130” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} [thee flee]{strong=“H5127” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w before| strong="H6440" \w* thee. 
\v 36 [And when it rested]{strong=“H5117” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, O \sc Lord\sc*, \w unto the many| strong="H7233" \w* \w thousands| strong="H505" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*.\f + \fr 10:36 \ft many thousands: Heb. ten thousand thousands \f*
\c 11
\p 
\v 1 And when \w the people| strong="H5971" \w* [complained]{strong=“H596” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8693”}, [it displeased]{strong=“H241 H7451”} the \sc Lord\sc*: and the \sc Lord\sc* [heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} it; \w and his anger| strong="H639" \w* [was kindled]{strong=“H2734” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; \w and the fire| strong="H784" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* [burnt]{strong=“H1197” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [among them, and consumed]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} them that were \w in the uttermost parts| strong="H7097" \w* \w of the camp| strong="H4264" \w*.\f + \fr 11:1 \ft complained: or, were as it were complainers \f* \f + \fr 11:1 \ft it displeased: Heb. it was evil in the ears of \f* 
\v 2 \w And the people| strong="H5971" \w* [cried]{strong=“H6817” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto Moses| strong="H4872" \w*; \w and when Moses| strong="H4872" \w* [prayed]{strong=“H6419” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”} unto the \sc Lord\sc*, \w the fire| strong="H784" \w* [was quenched]{strong=“H8257” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}.\f + \fr 11:2 \ft was…: Heb. sunk \f* 
