\v 3 (\w Now the man| strong="H376" \w* \w Moses| strong="H4872" \w* was \w very| strong="H3966" \w* [meek]{strong=“H6035 H6035” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8675”}, \w above all the men| strong="H120" \w* which were \w upon the face| strong="H6440" \w* \w of the earth| strong="H127" \w*.) 
