\v 28 \w And Moses| strong="H4872" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Hereby ye shall know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} that the \sc Lord\sc* [hath sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [me to do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w all these works| strong="H4639" \w*; for I have not done them \w of mine own mind| strong="H3820" \w*. 
