\v 30 But if the \sc Lord\sc* [make]{strong=“H1254” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w a new thing| strong="H1278" \w*, \w and the earth| strong="H127" \w* [open]{strong=“H6475” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w her mouth| strong="H6310" \w*, [and swallow them up]{strong=“H1104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, with all that appertain [unto them, and they go down]{strong=“H3381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w quick| strong="H2416" \w* \w into the pit| strong="H7585" \w*; [then ye shall understand]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w that these men| strong="H582" \w* [have provoked]{strong=“H5006” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} the \sc Lord\sc*.\f + \fr 16:30 \ft make…: Heb. create a creature \f* 
\p
