\v 38 \w The censers| strong="H4289" \w* \w of these sinners| strong="H2400" \w* \w against their own souls| strong="H5315" \w*, [let them make]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w them broad| strong="H7555" \w* \w plates| strong="H6341" \w* for \w a covering| strong="H6826" \w* \w of the altar| strong="H4196" \w*: [for they offered]{strong=“H7126” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w them before| strong="H6440" \w* the \sc Lord\sc*, [therefore they are hallowed]{strong=“H6942” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: \w and they shall be a sign| strong="H226" \w* \w unto the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*. 
