\v 17 \w And for an unclean| strong="H2931" \w* person [they shall take]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w of the ashes| strong="H6083" \w* \w of the burnt heifer| strong="H8316" \w* \w of purification for sin| strong="H2403" \w*, \w and running| strong="H2416" \w* \w water| strong="H4325" \w* [shall be put]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w thereto in a vessel| strong="H3627" \w*:\f + \fr 19:17 \ft ashes: Heb. dust \f* \f + \fr 19:17 \ft running…: Heb. living waters shall be given \f* 
