\v 1 \w And Moses| strong="H4872" \w* [spake]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w unto the heads| strong="H7218" \w* \w of the tribes| strong="H4294" \w* \w concerning the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, [saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, This is \w the thing| strong="H1697" \w* which the \sc Lord\sc* [hath commanded]{strong=“H6680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”}. 
